tsrs-only: backport of oxc-project/tsrs#959 (fix(lint): leave suggestions out of the type check), not yet merged
upstream; drop this patch once the tsrs revision in `_packages/tsgo/upstream.json` contains it. No Go counterpart:
tsgolint's protocol never carries plugin diagnostics.

Oxlint reports every `--type-check` diagnostic as an error, so Effect suggestions (e.g. `schemaClassMissingBrand`)
failed `effect-tsgo --tsrs-lint ... --type-check` although `effect-tsgo tsrs --noEmit` passes (Effect-TS/tsgo#1025).
tsrs-lint now forwards only errors and warnings.

